    "homepage_image_text_GwqD8h": {
      "type": "homepage-image-text",
      "name": "Homepage image + text",
      "settings": {
        "background_color": "#fdf7f4",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Founder_Office_Headshot.jpg",
        "image_alt": "founder image",
        "heading": "Hi, I’m Angela!",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p><em>Founder of Honey Cloudz</em></p><p>I've spent more than 15 years in the swimwear industry designing for women's bodies, but I've always been the kind of person who sees something that could be better and can't quite leave it alone.</p><p>That instinct eventually led me to creating Honey Cloudz.</p><p>What started as solving one frustrating problem has grown into something I never could have imagined—and the women who've trusted us with their stories have played a huge part in getting us here.</p>",
        "link_label": "",
        "link_url": "",
        "image_radius": 30,
        "gap": 64,
        "padding_top": 64,
        "padding_bottom": 64
      }
    },
