        "subheading_font_size_mobile": 14,
        "subheading_spacing": 12,
        "heading": "It Started With One Very Annoying Bra Insert",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_color": "#212326",
        "heading_font_weight": "500",
        "heading_line_height": 120,
        "heading_letter_spacing": 0,
        "heading_font_size_desktop": 42,
        "heading_font_size_tablet": 32,
        "heading_font_size_mobile": 30,
        "heading_spacing": 16,
        "text": "<p>After years in swimwear, I knew traditional bra inserts all too well. They shifted, folded, bunched, and had a habit of disappearing in the wash.</p><p>Women had been dealing with the same frustrations for years and <strong>I knew there had to be a better way</strong>.</p><p>After years of prototyping, testing, and refining, Honey Cloudz launched in 2018 with our patented grippy-dot exterior design that helps keep your inserts comfortably in place without adhesives.</p><p>That first insert ended up opening the door to so much more.</p>",
        "text_color": "#3d3d3d",
