    "homepage_image_text_KPNiNQ": {
      "type": "homepage-image-text",
      "name": "Homepage image + text",
      "settings": {
        "background_color": "#fdf7f4",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1347a3dd5d08d9095e5807c62dc0ea24431abea4_1.png",
        "image_alt": "You Told Us What Was Missing",
        "heading": "You Told Us What Was Missing",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Women navigating mastectomies, lumpectomies, explant, reconstruction, and other breast surgeries began sharing what they needed too.</p><p>They were looking for comfortable options that felt lighter, looked natural, and helped them feel more like themselves.</p><p>So we listened. <br/><br/>Working with breast health nurses and professional bra fitters, we expanded Honey Cloudz into lightweight breast forms and balancing solutions shaped by what women told us they actually needed.</p><p><br/>The heart of everything we do is to help women feel <strong>more comfortable, more confident, and more like themselves</strong>.</p>",
